.TH GPT2CODEX 1 "October 2026" "0.1.0~alpha1"
.SH NAME
gpt2codex \- local project registry and persistent terminal session bridge
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gpt2codex --help
.br
.B gpt2codex projects list
.br
.B gpt2codex session
.I operation options
.SH DESCRIPTION
Local alpha CLI for registered projects. GNU screen is the default multiplexer;
tmux is optional. Codex is a separate operator-provided program.
Use --help for the full current command list.
.SH SAFETY
Starting a session requires an explicit local --approve-start.
Archive approval never authorizes a new start. Unknown or changed identities
are not adopted. Package installation does not create or control sessions.
.SH FILES
~/.config/chatgpt2codex/config.toml
.br
~/.config/chatgpt2codex/projects/
.br
~/.local/state/gpt2codex/
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gpt2codex-gui (1), screen (1), tmux (1)
